+!   {\tt elkpy\_rotmomfix} & set to {\tt .true.} to hold a coplanar texture's
+!    turn about its own plane normal & logical & {\tt .false.}}
+!   Only for a phase the energy does not depend on: a held phase that is not
+!   stationary leaves a residual the self-consistent loop cannot remove.
+!
